{"strongs": "H5371", "word": "נֵרְגַּל שַׂרְאֶ֫צֶר", "translit": "ne.re.gal shar.e.tser", "root": "נקק", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "Nergal-sar-ezer", "definition": "נֵרְגַּל שַׂרְאֶ֫צֶר proper name, masculine (so Baer Ginsb ; van d. H. ׳ שַׁר ), chief soothsayer ( רַבמָֿ֑ג ) in train of Nebuchad. Jer 39:3 a (strike out Gie , plausibly) v Jer 39:3 b, 13 (compare Schr COT on the passage ). נִרְגָּן see רגן", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5383')\">BDB5383</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5371')\">H5371</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5382')\">BDB5382</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5384')\">BDB5384</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>נֵרְגַּל שַׂרְאֶ֫צֶר</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Baer')\">Baer</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gi')\">Ginsb</lookup>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('van d.H.')\">van d. H.</lookup> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שַׁר</bdbheb>), chief soothsayer (<bdbheb>רַבמָֿ֑ג</bdbheb>) in train of Nebuchad. <ref ref=\"Jer 39:3\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(24,39,3)\">Jer 39:3</ref>a (strike out <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gie')\">Gie</lookup>, plausibly) v<ref ref=\"Jer 39:3\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(24,39,3)\">Jer 39:3</ref>b, 13 (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Schr')\">Schr<sup>COT on the passage</sup></lookup>). </p><hr><p><bdbheb>נִרְגָּן</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>רגן</reflink></bdbheb> </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Jer 39:3", "book": "JER", "chapter": 39, "verse": 3}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["נֵרְגַּל שַׂרְאֶ֫צֶר", "׳", "שַׁר", "רַבמָֿ֑ג", "נִרְגָּן", "רגן"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["Baer", "Gi", "Gie", "Schr", "van d.H."]}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB5383", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}